# Privacy: sensitive originals and audit working files.
# Originals live OUTSIDE this repository, in
#   ../enzoportobrasil-private-documents/
# Nothing sensitive is stored in-repo, so these rules are a second line of
# defence against an accidental re-add. They are deliberately narrow: they must
# not shadow legitimate research figures or certificates.
/enzoportobrasil-private-documents/
/assets/other_certificates/_archive/
/assets/reserve/personal/
.private_document_manifest.json
*.private-manifest.json
/scripts/privacy_audit/_work/
*.redaction-tmp.pdf
*.pre-redaction.pdf
